    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4f9e8530-9767-3fc0-a152-35ffbd269f2f",
                "word": "avast",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                        "entry_id": "4f9e8530-9767-3fc0-a152-35ffbd269f2f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hold fast!; cease!; stop!"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1ded2bc-b070-4928-8fed-913018d07be4",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "Then pull avvay, hoa up, hoa up, hoa up, ſo avaſt there, Sir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a708f1c-6882-4a03-b343-15735babddcd",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "Avaſt, brother, avaſt! ſheer off—Yo ho! you turnkey, vvhy don't you keep a better look out? here's one of your crazy priſoners broke from his laſhings, I do ſuppoſe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3a7e17f-3c0c-4bc8-ad23-37dd8316d480",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "[T]he sail went into the water, and he could not drag it in. \"Avast heaving,\" said Gascoigne, \"till I throw her up and take the wind out of it.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76da3f85-9e7f-4ad9-b7b4-bb72c1518b64",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "[S]he caught me as I was again trying to force the open the door. \"I won't allow it; I won't have my premises spoiled. Go for the locksmith, there's one about a mile from here. But avast!\" putting her hand in her side-pocket, \"here's a key that'll fit, I guess; let's see.\" And with that, she turned it in the lock; but, alas! Queequeg's supplemental bolt remained unwithdrawn within."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34bdf537-52fd-4322-a170-b592def6fd04",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "\"Avast, there!\" cried Silver. \"Who are you, Tom Morgan? Maybe you thought you was cap'n here, perhaps. By the powers, but I'll teach you better![…]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfce98d9-3fea-4f37-9872-73d6fddcb9d7",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "\"Avast there!\" cried the captain, and as though to punctuate his remark he swung the heavy stick he usually carried full upon the back of Billy's head."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e07afc37-1ecf-4a1a-93a7-4963ed6191c3",
                                "sense_id": "79369d66-7d48-3972-a45e-0fdc368ca98f",
                                "text": "\"That landlubber's stole me dog!\" Armpit cried. \"Avast, ye dog thief!\" he roared to the man."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fda27d93-7562-3ebd-b0f3-40f755ac5a82",
                        "entry_id": "4f9e8530-9767-3fc0-a152-35ffbd269f2f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In imitation of pirates: listen!; pay attention!"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36cd2813-00bc-479a-bd8e-8fcb16517823",
                                "sense_id": "fda27d93-7562-3ebd-b0f3-40f755ac5a82",
                                "text": "Avast, ye landlubbers!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85c5cb28-32be-4529-ab2c-6fce5f0f305d",
                                "sense_id": "fda27d93-7562-3ebd-b0f3-40f755ac5a82",
                                "text": "[“Pirate Talk: How to Make It Work for You”, page 35] Avast—\"Stop and give attention.\" It can be used in a sense of surprise: \"Whoa! Get a load of that!\" when a beautiful woman walks into the room. \"Avast! Check out the bowsprit on that fine beauty!\" you might say. […] [“Cap’n Slappy’s Practical Parrot Pointers”, page 166] Arrrr! Avast, Cap'n Slappy. Does ye know where the treasure of the Sierra Madre be buried? If ye don't tell me its whereabouts, I'll have to swing ye from the yardarm, matey."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
